COMPATIBILITY NOTE
==================

The Free Software Foundation permits combining AGPLv3 and GPLv3 work: AGPLv3
section 13 carries an explicit permission for it. TSP is therefore GPLv3, while
PyMuPDF stays AGPLv3. Neither licence changes the other.

If a project needs permissive licensing, pypdf (BSD) and pdfplumber (MIT) cover
text extraction, at some cost in extraction quality and with no page rendering.
